sequenceDiagram
    %% SD6 - Look back and re-estimate
    %% Stories: 13, 35, 39
    %% Description: A participant scrolls back through earlier rounds; the moderator reopens an earlier item and everyone sees each estimator's prior estimates before estimating again.
    actor M as Moderator
    actor P as Participant
    participant G as Game
    participant R as Round
    participant I as Item
    participant ES as Estimate
    participant E as Estimator

    P->>G: scroll back through earlier rounds [39]
    G->>R: getItemsAndEstimates() for each earlier round
    G-->>P: items and estimates of earlier rounds
    M->>R: select an item estimated earlier [13]
    R->>I: reopen()
    I->>ES: getPriorEstimates()
    ES->>E: getName()
    I-->>P: prior estimates per estimator [35]
    Note over M,E: the item is then estimated again as in SD4
